      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.28,
      "end_seconds": 50.22,
      "duration_seconds": 28.94,
      "text": "Since last night, that's when it began. My family kept telling me to get it checked. It's the not knowing that gets to me. Okay, so and there's loose stools now and then as well, two weeks now. About loose stools now and then, it feels severe to me"
